WEBVTT

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:06.260
December 1866

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:53.140
Where are you headed

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:55.110
Boat of sincerity

00:01:55.110 --> 00:02:03.580
With your flag of burning ambition raised?

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:06.550
Hakuoki: A Memory of Snow Flowers

00:02:06.650 --> 00:02:14.790
If you are going to simply force your way forward

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:21.930
As if fighting against the fierce river currents

00:02:21.930 --> 00:02:25.770
I want to accompany you

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:30.000
Even if the way is unclear

00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:37.380
I believe in what lays beyond the torrents yonder

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:41.350
When you wander through the long night

00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:45.990
Of spiritual darkness

00:02:45.990 --> 00:02:50.030
I want to strike a small light for you

00:02:50.030 --> 00:02:55.190
With my own little hands

00:02:56.270 --> 00:02:58.470
Where are you headed

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:00.370
O blue ship

00:03:00.370 --> 00:03:04.180
You face an indiscernible tomorrow

00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:08.080
As you risk everything, as you risk your life

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:14.310
In search of the distant arcadia

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:25.890
<i>Episode 3
The Speaz that Slices the Sky</i>

00:18:28.770 --> 00:18:30.900
Official Papers

00:21:57.040 --> 00:22:01.880
Nurui ame kasa wa iranu
In the wet rain, I don't need an umbrella

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:07.950
Yoi wa fukeyuki kizuato ga uzuku
Evening falls and my scars ache

00:22:07.950 --> 00:22:14.330
Kirigumo hakobu honojiroi kaori wa
Carried by the cloud of mist, the gray fragrance

00:22:14.330 --> 00:22:19.960
Ranse ni saita kuruoshii hana
Is a mad flower blooming in wild times

00:22:19.960 --> 00:22:26.300
Araragi yo mumyou no kurayami mo
O orchid, even in the midst of true darkness

00:22:26.300 --> 00:22:32.310
Kishimu kizu daite kiri saite yuku no sa
Embrace those grating injuries
as you slash open the path

00:22:32.310 --> 00:22:39.780
Kesshite furimukazu asamashii namida mo
Never look back as you fill even your

00:22:39.780 --> 00:22:42.450
Yaiba ni komete
shameful tears with blades

00:22:42.450 --> 00:22:45.750
Iza tatakai no toki
Now is the time to fight

00:23:13.750 --> 00:23:15.960
Episode 4
A Drifting Boat
